            "value" : "Replace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拼图模式用的是这张" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pattern mode uses this one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这份图纸读不出来了" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This pattern can't be read"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拼图模式会退回用封面。重新选一张就好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pattern mode will fall back to the cover. Just pick another one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存在本机，不占用 iCloud" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stored on this device, not in iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 存在本机，不占用 iCloud" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ · Stored on this device, not in iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有图纸原图" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No pattern original"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拼图模式会拿封面凑合，一格豆子的像素少一半。相册里还留着原图就选一下。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pattern mode will make do with the cover, where each bead gets half the pixels. If the original is still in your photos, pick it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这张图取不出来。如果它还在 iCloud 里，等下载完再试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This image can't be loaded. If it's still in iCloud, try again once it finishes downloading."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没存进去，可能是手机空间不够。原来那张还在。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't save it — you may be out of space. The previous one is still there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没删掉，稍后再试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't delete it. Try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "换成这张图纸？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use this as the pattern?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "换掉这张图纸原图？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Replace this pattern original?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拼图模式以后就用这张来看每一格的颜色。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pattern mode will use this one to read each bead's color."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "现在这张会被盖掉。它不进 iCloud、也不在备份里，换掉就找不回来了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The current one will be overwritten. It isn't in iCloud or your backups, so it's gone for good."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删掉这张图纸原图？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete this pattern original?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拼图模式仍然能用，但只能拿封面凑合，看格子会糊一些。它不进 iCloud、也不在备份里，删了要重新从相册选。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pattern mode still works, but it can only make do with the cover, so the grid looks blurrier. It isn't in iCloud or your backups — delete it and you'll have to pick it from your photos again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "列表里显示的就是这张" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is what shows in the list"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "裁切或换一张都不影响拼图模式用的图纸" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cropping or replacing it doesn't affect the pattern used by pattern mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个项目没有单独的图纸，拼图模式用的就是这张" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This project has no separate pattern — pattern mode uses this one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂无封面" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No cover yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不加也行，列表里会显示一个占位图" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional — the list will show a placeholder instead"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个项目在拼图模式里已经对好了图纸，而它是照着现在这张封面对的（这个项目没有图纸原图）。改完取景就对不上了，得重新对一遍。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You've already aligned the pattern in pattern mode, and it was aligned against this cover (this project has no pattern original). Changing the framing will throw it off — you'd have to align it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里设置的是默认值，每张图纸在上传时都可以单独选择是否保留原图。\n原图只用在拼图模式里，用来看清每一格的颜色。列表和详情页仍然用压缩后的图；原图存在本机，不占 iCloud、不进备份。拼完之后可以删掉它：项目详情页的「图纸原图」那一行，或者「多零件模式」零件清单页的「拼好了」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is the default; each pattern can keep or skip its original when you upload it.\nOriginals are only used in Pattern Mode, to read each bead's color clearly. Lists and detail pages still use the compressed image; the original lives on this device, outside iCloud and backups. When you're done you can delete it — from the “Pattern Original” row on the project detail page, or via “All done” on the parts list in Multi-part Mode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这 %lld 格本来就是「%@」，没有改动" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Those %lld cells were already \u201c%@\u201d \u2014 nothing changed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刚把 %lld 格改成「%@」" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just changed %lld cells to \u201c%@\u201d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "描红边那 %lld 个零件跟旁边挨着，烫完会连成一片。拖开一点，或者上面「加一块」板。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The %lld outlined-red pieces are touching their neighbours and will fuse when ironed. Drag them apart, or add another board above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 %lld 个零件（描红边那几个）跟旁边挨着了。挨着的豆子烫完会连成一片，得拿剪刀分开，那一刀下去边缘就毁了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld pieces (the ones outlined in red) are touching their neighbours. Touching beads fuse when ironed and have to be cut apart, which ruins the edge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 %lld 块对不上任何零件了，已经从板上清掉" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld placements no longer match any piece and were cleared off the board"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」原地放不下，挪到旁边空地了" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” no longer fits where it was and moved to free space nearby"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 %lld 个零件原地放不下，挪到旁边空地了" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld pieces no longer fit where they were and moved to free space nearby"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这一块对不上任何零件了" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This no longer matches any piece"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出去回零件清单看看。在这儿改也存不下来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Go back to the piece list and check — nothing edited here can be saved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这一层这次画不出来，屏幕上是上一次的样子；底下那个颗数才是准的。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This layer couldn't be redrawn; you're seeing the previous state. The bead count below is the accurate one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "挑的那个色号在这张图纸的色号体系里没有对应的，换一个。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That colour has no equivalent in this pattern's colour system — pick another."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先在上面挑一个色号，再划过要补上的格子。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick a colour above first, then swipe across the cells you want to add."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对照图纸" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Compare to pattern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "看零件" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show piece"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这次取不到图纸上的这一块，没法对照图纸 —— 照着手上的实物改。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't load this part of the pattern, so there's nothing to compare against — edit it against the piece in your hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "擦掉 / 补上" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
