    "拖动看图，两指捏合放大。要改格子，上面换「擦掉」或「补上」。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drag to look around, pinch to zoom. To change cells, switch to Erase or Add above."
