        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The grid lines should sit in the seams between beads. The whole sheet shares this one grid, so it doesn't matter which piece you adjust it on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "现在用的是压缩过的副本，放大到一颗豆子会糊。相册里还留着这张图纸的原图吗？" : {
