    "这里取不到颜色，换个地方点点看。要是哪儿都取不到，退回零件清单那屏，用上面的提示条补一张原图就清楚了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No color could be picked up here — try tapping somewhere else. If nowhere works, go back to the piece list and add the original photo from the banner there."
          }
        }
